{
  "version": "0.9.58",
  "notes": "Adds three explicitly invoked, read-only specialist teams and concise team commands; makes simulated or hypothetical dialogues, including GitHub-bridge text-only exercises, get direct in-role replies without authorising real actions; routes genuine XemAi self-source questions to real read-only developer tools with transparent missing-evidence reports instead of public web research, and rejects some invented class/function claims; adds offline conversation-evaluation and lesson-report tools. No new permissions, source-edit or shell tools, model-weight training or 9B changes; preserves chats, memory, credentials and hybrid pairing.",
